ng.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-tertiary-fixed/60 border border-tertiary-fixed text-xs text-on-surface shadow-2xs"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary text-[18px] shrink-0 mt-0.5">confirmation_number</span><div class="flex-1"><p class="font-bold text-on-surface">Mã giảm giá</p><p class="text-on-surface-variant text-[11px] mt-0.5">Mã sàn SAN10K và mã Shop đã sẵn sàng trong giỏ hàng.</p></div></div></div></div></div>
